      "type": "Youngtimer Car Auction · ends 7 Dec",
      "description": "HIGHLIGHTS:\n• 2006 American Hummer H3 off-roader\n• Custom bodywork with pinstriping and a new windshield\n• Well-preserved two-tone black and tan leather interior\n• Fitted with BF Goodrich off-road tyres in good condition\n• Supplied with Danish documents (registered as a commercial vehicle, with tax benefits in Denmark)\n\nHISTORY/OVERVIEW:\nIntroduced in 2005 as a more compact and agile model than the earlier H1 and H2, the Hummer H3 retained the muscular design and off-road capability of the American marque, while adopting the GMT355 body-on-frame platform and permanent four-wheel drive. This example dates from 2006, features custom exterior pinstriping and is currently registered with Danish documents.\n\nBODYWORK/PAINT:\nThe bodywork is in good overall condition and enhanced by pinstriping; the windshield has been replaced with a new one. One running board has a broken bracket that needs to be welded. The wheels require restoration or repainting, while one area of rust on the frame needs attention.\n\nINTERIOR:\nThe cabin features two-tone black and tan leather upholstery (with tan piping) on the front seats and rear bench, along with matching tan leather inserts on the door panels. The dark dashboard incorporates a centre console with a satin finish, factory radio, rotary climate controls, automatic transmission selector and a four-spoke multifunction steering wheel bearing the H3 emblem. The interior is well preserved and tidy overall, with slight creasing from use on the front seat bolsters and normal signs of wear on the floor mats.\n\nMECHANICS:\nThe engine and transmission are in good working order, and no engine or warning lights are illuminated on the instrument panel. The vehicle is fitted with BF Goodrich tyres in good condition.\n\nDOCUMENTS:\nThe vehicle comes with Danish documents and is registered as a commercial vehicle, with tax benefits in Denmark.\n\nThe vehicle can be viewed and collected by appointment.",
      "price": 1000,
