      "description": "HIGHLIGHTS:\n• Iconic 1988 Ferrari 328 GTS with removable hardtop\n• Registered with the ASI Historic Register and awarded the Targa Oro\n• Original alloy wheels fitted with new tires\n• Always stored indoors in a garage; timing belts replaced about 6 years ago, with very few miles driven since\n\nHISTORY/OVERVIEW:\nPresented at the 1985 Frankfurt Motor Show as an evolution of the 308, the Ferrari 328 GTS (Gran Turismo Spider) represents the pinnacle of the celebrated family of Pininfarina-designed, mid-engined, transversely mounted V8 berlinettas. Featuring a 3.2-liter (3,185 cc), 32-valve V8 producing 270 hp, paired with a 5-speed manual transmission, it combined impressive performance with the elegance of a targa body and removable hardtop. The example offered dates from 1987, has always been stored indoors in a garage, and is registered with the ASI Historic Register with Targa Oro status.\n\nBODYWORK/PAINT:\nThe bodywork is in excellent overall condition, with no obvious damage or scratches. Some parts, including the bumper and the lower section of the right-hand side, were repainted a few years ago. The seals, windows, and light assemblies are original and remain in good condition; the only noted omission is the Pininfarina badge on the right-hand side. The exterior is completed by well-preserved original alloy wheels fitted with new tires.\n\nINTERIOR:\nThe cabin retains its original interior in good condition, as does the removable hardtop. All onboard electronic components are in good working order.\n\nMECHANICAL:\nThe engine and transmission operate correctly, and the car is mechanically in good order. The last service and timing-belt replacement were carried out 6 years ago, and the car has covered only a few miles since then. The braking system has discs and brakes in good condition, along with new tires.\n\nDOCUMENTS:\nThe car comes with documents stated to be in order and registration with the ASI Historic Register with Targa Oro status.\n\nThe car can be viewed and collected by appointment.",
      "price": 42500,
